        "description": "**POST** `/Ordering/ClientOrder/GetPrice`\n\nCalculates the shipping price for a parcel. **Read-only** — does not create an order.\n\n`weight` is in **grams**. The price is returned at `data.totalPrice` (and `data.payableAmount`). Verified working against the live API.",
